<title>NEW ZEALAND: Decision on Mercury and Power upheld-NZCC.</title>
<headline>Decision on Mercury and Power upheld-NZCC.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The anti-monopolies Commerce Commission said on Monday that the Court of Appeal had upheld its decision to clear Mercury Energy to acquire all of Power New Zealand Ltd's shares.</p>
</text>
